Update the IntelliJ research source mirror and navigation using the maintainer workflow.

The maintainer must run `prepare-update`, use the complete update report and changed paths only as audit evidence, update only the candidate's `Routing Guide` when existing navigation would mislead or block research, verify every route, and run `finalize-update`. Do not treat the update as complete until the candidate has been validated and promoted. Report repository revisions, navigation changes, and any validation failures.

